/span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"正方形\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">  Rect</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> { w, h } </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=></span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> println!</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"{}x{}\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, w, h),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">}</span></span></code></pre>",
